# AAS–AIM browser client — public environment configuration template.
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local for local settings; do not edit this template
# with deployment-specific credentials or secrets.
#
# Every VITE_* value can be embedded in client-side JavaScript at build time.
# Never store passwords, API keys, access tokens, signing secrets, database
# credentials, or other private material in VITE_* variables.
#
# Reserved API path for a FUTURE authenticated, versioned AIM API client.
# Use a same-origin reverse proxy when the backend is connected.
# The current Vite configuration does NOT proxy /api, and the current
# React prototype does NOT make API requests. This setting is presently inert.
# Public configuration is not an authorization or security boundary.
VITE_AIM_API_BASE_PATH=/api
